\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Ratio IPR$_{\rm  trib}$ / IPR$_{\rm  fib}$ as a function of $\lambda $. The dashed line marks the linear-limit ratio ($\approx 3.91$). The ratio increases to $\sim 8.6$ at $\lambda = 1.5$ before declining at large coupling, quantifying the differential nonlinear robustness of the tribonacci state in the moderate-coupling regime.}}{9}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ratio}{{5}{9}{Ratio IPR$_{\rm trib}$ / IPR$_{\rm fib}$ as a function of $\lambda $. The dashed line marks the linear-limit ratio ($\approx 3.91$). The ratio increases to $\sim 8.6$ at $\lambda = 1.5$ before declining at large coupling, quantifying the differential nonlinear robustness of the tribonacci state in the moderate-coupling regime}{figure.caption.8}{}}
